{"en": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The main hall at Øyahuset can accommodate up to 150 people.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The hall can be used for all types of events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;If you want to rent with kitchen facilities, you must apply for the entire district building or you can optionally write in the comment field that you want access to a kitchen in shared use with other users.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The room is also equipped with: microphone, small stage, speakers, projector, screen, large mirror on one of the walls, disco lights for children&#039;s birthdays, teleloop for the hearing impaired.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The individual must bring their own PC, CD player, etc., as well as the associated cables.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The town hall has another microphone for loan by agreement.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The town hall has a wireless internet connection.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;Attention is drawn to the fact that it is not permitted to use alcohol in the municipal district buildings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;This is in accordance with a decision in the municipal council for upbringing and living conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;", "nn": "", "no": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Storsalen på Øyahuset kan dekkes med inntil 150 personer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Salen kan brukes til alle type arrangementer. Ønsker du å leie med kjøkkenfasiliteter må du søke om hele bydelshuset eller du kan eventuelt skrive i kommentarfeltet at du ønsker tilgang til kjøkken i sambruk med andre brukere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Rommet disponeres i tillegg med: mikrofon, liten scenen, høyttalere, projektor, lerret, stort speil på 1 av veggene, diskolys til barnebursdag, teleslynge for nedsatt hørsel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;PC, Cd spiller etc. må den enkelte ta med selv, samt tilhørende ledninger.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bydelshuset har annen mikrofon for utlån etter avtale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bydelshuset har trådløs internettforbindelse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Det gjøres oppmerksom på at det ikke er tillatt å nyte alkohol på de kommunale bydelshus. Dette i henhold til vedtak i kommunalstyret for oppvekst og levekår.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"}

