{"en": "", "nn": "", "no": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;English below:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Barnehagerommet blir disponert av Åpen barnehage mandag, tirsdag onsdag og torsdag på dagtid.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Det er mulig å reservere Barnehagerommet til dans, trening, undervisning, små selskap og møter. Rommet har et kjøkken (kjøleskap/ovn), et spisebord, en sofa og direkte tillgang til lekeplassen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lekene/utstyr følger ikke med - disse er eid av Bamsefaret Åpen Barnehage og leies ikke ut. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flere stoler/bord kan fraktes fra andre rom om nødvendig (må leveres tilbake).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Tidspunktet du bestiller inkluderer forberedelse og renhold.  &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;English: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The kindergarten room is used by Open Kindergarten on Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday during the day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;It is possible to book the Kindergarten Room for dancing, training, teaching, small parties and meetings.The room has an oven and a small fridge, a dining table, a sofa and direct access to the playground.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;More chairs and tables may be borrowed from other rooms, please remember to take them back. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The time you book includes preparation and cleaning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;The toys/mats are not for rent - it is Bamsefaret Åpen Barnehage that owns these and we do not rent them out. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"}

{"en": "", "nn": "", "no": "&lt;p&gt;Honningkrukka kan brukes til møter, undervisning og små selskap inntil 25 personer. Det er utstyrt med 2 møtebord, smart TV, to tavler (skrivesaker må medbringers, OBS - ikke permanente penner!) og en sofa. Piano er tilgjengelig på rommet. Rommet har ikke kjøkken. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alkohol er ikke tillatt. Dette i henhold til vedtak i kommunalstyret for oppvekst og levekår.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Tidspunktet du bestiller inkluderer forberedelse og renhold.  &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Renholdsrutiner,  brannsikkerhet og innbruddsalarm vil bli gjennomgått  ved henting av nøkler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;English:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The honey pot room can be used for meetings, teaching and small parties for up to 25 people. It is equipped with 2 meeting tables, a smart TV, two whiteboards (please bring your own writing pens, OBS - not permanent pens!) and a sofa.  There is a piano in this room, too. This room has no kitchen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Alcohol is not allowed. This is in accordance with decisions in the municipal council.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;The time you book includes preparation and cleaning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cleaning routines, fire safety and burglary alarms will be reviewed when collecting keys.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"}

{"en": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The leisure club can be hired for children&#039;s birthdays and class parties on Fridays, Saturdays and Sundays when The HUndvåg Youthclub is not using the premises itself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;(Children aged between 0-12 years - that go in kindergarten and primary school).

&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The premises consist of the hall, cafe, disco and kitchen.

&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The discotheque is equipped with: disco lights, music system and has large mirrors on the walls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;", "nn": "", "no": "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Fritidsklubben kan leies til barnebursdager og klassefester fredager, lørdager og søndager når fritidsklubben ikke bruker lokalene selv. (Barn i alderen mellom 0-12 år, barnehagebarn og barneskole).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lokalene består av hallen, kafeen, diskotek og kjøkken.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Diskoteket er utstyrt med: diskolys, musikkanlegg og har store speil på veggene. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"}

{"en": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;Small meeting room has space for approx.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;6-10 people.

&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The resource board can be borrowed from Peisestuen.

&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;Located between the Peisestuen and the hairdresser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;", "nn": "", "no": "&lt;p&gt;Lille møterom har plass til ca. 6-10 personer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ressurstavlen kan lånes fra Peisestuen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ligger mellom peisestua og frisøren.&lt;/p&gt;"}

{"en": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The kitchen is well equipped and has cutlery for approx.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;100 people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;Kitchen is a shared facility in the community house.

&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;The kitchen is approved by the Norwegian Food Safety Authority and can be used for cooking food for sale.

&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jCAhz ChMk0b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ryNqvb&quot;&gt;If you need more room and need a kitchen just for yourselves, then you must apply specifically for this - in some cases, joint use of the kitchen must be calculated for.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;", "nn": "", "no": "&lt;p&gt;Kjøkkenet er velutstyrt og har dekketøy til ca. 100 personer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kjøkken er et felles fasilitet for overetasjen på bydelshuset.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kjøkken er godkjent av mattilsynet og kan brukes til matlaging av mat til salgs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dersom du i tillegg ønsker mer rom og trenger kjøkken bare for dere selv, så må du søke spesifikk om dette -  i enkelte tilfelle må det beregnes sambruk av kjøkken.&lt;/p&gt;"}
